---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "10 Apps You Need to Download Before Traveling to China";
const description = "The apps you need to survive and thrive in China — payment, transport, translation, and more.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Life
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">px-6 py-4文本-紫色-600字体粗体文本lg</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        10 Apps You Need to Download<br class="hidden md:block" /> Before Traveling to China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">在前往中国之前</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>忘记谷歌和脸书吧——这是你真正需要的。</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">⏱️ 阅读4分钟</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        China runs on apps. Forget Google and Facebook — here you need <strong>中国靠应用程序运行。忘记谷歌和脸书吧——你需要</strong> for messaging and paying, <strong>Alipay</strong> for shopping, <strong>Didi</strong> for rides, and <strong>Amap</strong> for directions. Download these <strong>之前</strong> you arrive, because some (like Google services) are harder to access once you're inside China.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 在本指南中</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#payment" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💳 支付应用</a></li>
        <li><a href="#messaging" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💬 消息和社交</a></li>
        <li><a href="#transport" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚗 交通与导航</a></li>
        <li><a href="#travel" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏨 旅游预订</a></li>
        <li><a href="#translation" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔤 翻译与语言</a></li>
        <li><a href="#food" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍜 美食与探索</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="payment" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💳</span> Payment Apps
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">💬 微信</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">中国的超级应用。您将使用它来发送消息、在商店付款、分摊账单、订购食物、预约等。中国几乎每家企业都接受微信支付，从高档餐厅到街头小吃摊。用信用卡（Visa/Mastercard）设置它，你就可以走了。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">💳 支付宝</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">中国另一半的支付双头垄断。支付宝在网上购物（淘宝、天猫）方面尤其强大。与微信一样，它可以用于各种支付场景，也可以用于公共交通和共享自行车等实用的小程序。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="messaging" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💬</span> Messaging & Social
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">💬 微信</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">是的，微信也是你的消息应用程序。每个人都通过微信交流——导游会通过微信群进行协调，当地联系人会希望你拥有它。忘记WhatsApp吧，国内没有人使用它。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="transport" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚗</span> Transport & Navigation
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">🚗 滴滴出行</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">中国的叫车应用。您可以用英文输入目的地，提前查看票价，并使用支付宝或微信支付。在每个大城市工作。使用它而不是叫出租车——你可以避免沟通问题，而且更便宜。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-3">🗺️ Amap或百度地图</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">谷歌地图在中国不提供逐向导航。这两种是当地的替代方案。他们从事驾驶、公共交通、步行，甚至寻找附近的餐馆。两者都有一些英语支持，但百度地图对外国人更友好。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-900 mb-3">🏨 Trip.com（搜索程序）</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">携程网的英文版——中国最大的旅游预订平台。预订航班、火车、酒店和景点。有完整的英语支持，接受外国信用卡。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="translation" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔤</span> Translation & Language
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-yellow-900 mb-3">🌐 谷歌翻译</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">最可靠的选择。下载中文包以供离线使用。相机翻译功能对于菜单、标志和包装来说是无价的。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-yellow-900 mb-3">📖 鲶鱼</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">汉英词典的黄金标准。它支持照片和语音翻译，因此在各种情况下都非常方便。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="food" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍜</span> Food & Discovery
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">⭐ 大众点评</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">中国的Yelp。按菜肴、价格、位置和评级查找餐厅。界面只有中文，但照片和地图很容易导航。用它来发现隐藏的当地宝石。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">🍜 Amap Street Food Ranking</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">A hidden gem inside Amap. This feature ranks restaurants based on real user behavior — how many people actually navigated there, how many went back multiple times, and how many traveled a long distance just to eat there. Unlike Dianping (where reviews can be bought), the 扫街榜 is based on <strong>真实的足迹</strong>, and Amap has publicly stated it will <strong>从不接受付费房源</strong>.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">只需打开Amap→ 搜索“街头小吃”→看看你附近的当地人到底在吃什么。它非常适合那些想跳过旅游陷阱并找到真正优惠的旅行者。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 您的中国之旅生存工具包</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">您旅行的主清单</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/sim-card-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📶 游客最佳SIM卡和eSIM</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">与数据计划保持联系</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">💳 如何设置支付宝</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">几分钟内连接您的卡</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-wechat/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">💬 如何设置微信支付</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">微信对中国至关重要</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Sources</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>基于实际旅行经验的应用程序推荐。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>